---
// Standards.astro — Core Principles & Direct Trade Standard
---

<section class="standards-section" aria-label="Our Ethical Trade Standards">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="standards-grid">

      <div class="standard-card">
        <span class="standard-idx font-mono">01 / FIRST HANDS</span>
        <h3 class="standard-title font-serif">Named Growers</h3>
        <p class="standard-desc">
          Every harvest is credited to the specific family who grew and gathered it. We work directly with native practitioners whose ecological knowledge is the true credential.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="standard-card">
        <span class="standard-idx font-mono">02 / TERROIR</span>
        <h3 class="standard-title font-serif">Never Blended</h3>
        <p class="standard-desc">
          100% single origin from specific micro-climates in the Western Ghats. We never mix harvests from different farms or seasons. You taste the true soil and weather of that place.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="standard-card">
        <span class="standard-idx font-mono">03 / ECOLOGY</span>
        <h3 class="standard-title font-serif">Nature’s Share</h3>
        <p class="standard-desc">
          Harvested in sync with the forest canopy. Native growers leave the unripened berries and the forest canopy intact for wild wildlife, harvesting only what the earth yields willingly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="standard-card standard-card--cta">
        <span class="standard-idx font-mono">04 / THE PROOF</span>
        <h3 class="standard-title font-serif">Open Ledger</h3>
        <p class="standard-desc">
          We publish the exact price paid to growers (typically 40–60% above local market benchmarks) alongside verifiable geo-coordinates and batch numbers.
        </p>
        <a href="/ledger" class="standard-link font-sans">
          <span>Inspect the Ledger</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .standards-section {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-bone-card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .standards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .standards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .standards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .standard-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bone);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: 6px;
    transition: transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-smooth), box-shadow var(--duration-base) var(--ease-smooth);
  }

  .standard-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    border-color: var(--color-border-medium);
  }

  .standard-card--cta {
    background-color: var(--color-forest-dark);
    color: var(--color-bone);
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .standard-card--cta .standard-title {
    color: var(--color-bone);
  }

  .standard-card--cta .standard-desc {
    color: var(--color-forest-muted);
  }

  .standard-idx {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-mark-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .standard-title {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-deep-forest);
  }

  .standard-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .standard-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-mark-gold);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .standard-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
